Hi, all.

On November 2nd in Amsterdam, Inktank and 42on are hosting the very first full-day Ceph workshop, and we'd like you to join us!

The workshop will be tailored for new and experienced Ceph users alike, and will be attended by a slew of Inktank folks and other experts - including Sage! Sessions will cover Ceph's history and architecture, and we plan to share a few successful case studies. We also plan to run an installation workshop for those who are new to Ceph.

More details will be provided soon...but for now, save the date!

